#ASSERT `does Article 9 apply to the instrument` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council` (YMD 1930 1 1) EQUALS `as it stands, the instrument being a Law`
#ASSERT `does Article 9 apply to the instrument` (YMD 2020 6 1) `a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council` (YMD 1954 8 21) EQUALS `as it stands, the instrument being a Law`
-- M16-M17  V1 src:44 and src:46: regulations made under a Law, or an Order or bye-laws under the authority of an Order in Council, are subordinate enactments: with the necessary changes
#ASSERT `does Article 9 apply to the instrument` (YMD 2020 6 1) `regulations, an Order, rules, bye-laws, a scheme or other instrument passed or made in Jersey under a Law passed by the States and confirmed in Council` (YMD 1990 1 1) EQUALS `with the necessary changes, the instrument being a subordinate enactment`
#ASSERT `does Article 9 apply to the instrument` (YMD 2020 6 1) `regulations, an Order, rules, bye-laws, a scheme or other instrument passed or made in Jersey under the authority of an Order in Council` (YMD 1990 1 1) EQUALS `with the necessary changes, the instrument being a subordinate enactment`
